ign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">60</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 89.75pt; HEIGHT: 22.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">자기점검</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(5점 척도)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 60.44pt; HEIGHT: 22.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">제한없음</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; WIDTH: 77.42pt; HEIGHT: 22.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">☞ 온라인으로 이루어지므로 시간과 장소에 구애받지 않고 응시할 수 있으며, 예</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">상시간은 4개영역 약 200분이고, 영역별 및 문제별로 임시저장이 가능하므로 지</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">정된 기간 내에만 완료하시면 되고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">, 완료 후 진달결과 확인은 학생개인별로 문자</span></p><p class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">메세지 발송 예정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">▣ 혜 택 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 응시료(25,000원) 전액 지원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">- 평가 결과에 따라 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">인센티브 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">지급(변경될 수 있음) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span s